@startuml BudgetDarpanMockIdentity
!include _theme.puml
title Budget Darpan — Mock Nagarik-Style Identity Verification
caption Security demonstration only; not an official Nagarik App integration
autonumber

actor Citizen
participant "Vercel React SPA\n/verify" as UI
participant "Render Mock Identity Server\nbudget-darpan-identity" as IDP
database "Fictional Seeded Identities" as Seeds
participant "Render Budget Darpan API\nbudget-darpan-api" as API
database "Neon PostgreSQL\nCitizenProfile + VerificationRecord" as DB

Citizen -> UI : enter phone + citizenship number
UI -> IDP : Vercel /api/proxy (identity)\nPOST /verification/start
IDP -> Seeds : constant-time fictional match
Seeds --> IDP : stable subject + municipality + ward
IDP --> UI : challenge_id + optional demo OTP hint
Citizen -> UI : enter OTP
UI -> IDP : Vercel /api/proxy (identity)\nPOST /verification/confirm
IDP --> UI : one-time authorization code (60 s)
UI -> API : POST /api/v1/verification/complete/\nwith one-time code + session/CSRF
API -> IDP : backend POST /verification/exchange\n+ shared client secret
IDP -> IDP : consume code once
IDP -> IDP : sign short-lived RS256 assertion
IDP --> API : JWT assertion\niss + aud + sub + jti + exp
API -> IDP : GET /.well-known/jwks.json\nor use configured public key
IDP --> API : RSA public key
API -> API : verify signature, issuer, audience, expiry and jti
API -> API : citizen_key = HMAC(secret, issuer + subject)
API -> DB : unique citizen key + hashed token identifier
DB --> API : verified citizen profile
API --> UI : verified_citizen status
UI --> Citizen : verification badge

== Duplicate-safe feedback ==
Citizen -> UI : submit rating for project
UI -> API : POST feedback + idempotency key
API -> DB : UNIQUE(citizen_profile, project)
alt first feedback
  DB --> API : created
  API --> UI : success
else duplicate feedback
  DB --> API : constraint violation
  API --> UI : clear duplicate response; edit original
end

note over IDP,API
  Raw phone and citizenship values are never stored
  in the Budget Darpan application database or logs.
end note

note over UI,API
  A second Gmail/username cannot create a second verified citizen:
  the same signed subject always produces the same unique HMAC citizen key.
end note
@enduml
